                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "To do this we will have to percolate the useSignalWait arg through many functions in the call stack, and I am not sure this additional code is better than the limited duplication that exists."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuSensorMain.cpp",
