                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "Do we also need matches for InterfaceRemoved and PropertiesChanged for Connectivity property? @santosh.puranik.ibm@gmail.com, is PropertiesChanged for Connectivity property is supported? I see that pldmd has enabled support for it."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuSensorMain.cpp",
                    "line": 57,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kodihalli",
                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "Need to think about this and get a follow up patch (need to decide if we want to react to InterfacesRemoved). I will do this in a follow up."
                }
